        <mxCell id="BGdJjveW1re_Af29f9yz-42" value="&lt;div&gt;Redis session data loss (e.g., mediator state, JWT cache) triggers a forced re-login, not systemic failure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;We treat Redis as a coordination surface — the RecoveryModule uses delta logs and snapshots to guarantee correctness.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;OutboxWriter ensures write-attempts persist during outages. Session-specific loss is acceptable, traceable, and recoverable.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3500" y="2330" width="680" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
